{"id":"899007f1346b21cf","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-stlc-syntactic-category.md","title":"简单类型演算的句法 CCC","display":"df-stlc-syntactic-category — 简单类型演算的句法 CCC","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"2","label":"16-df-stlc-syntactic-category","aliases":["16-df-stlc-syntactic-category","STLC classifying CCC"],"display":"df-stlc-syntactic-category — 简单类型演算的句法 CCC","depends_on":["[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]","[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"source":"Proposition 2.3.2, pp. 139–140 (PDF 159–160); Exercise 2.3.3, p. 146 (PDF 166); local reconstruction with equations","review_status":"source-construction-and-local-proof","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-stlc-syntactic-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-stlc-syntactic-category</span><span>STLC classifying CCC</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stlc-syntactic-category — 简单类型演算的句法 CCC"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"435152fdfa38036a\" href=\"?note=435152fdfa38036a\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntax\">16-df-stlc-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 2.3.2, pp. 139–140 (PDF 159–160); Exercise 2.3.3, p. 146 (PDF 166); local reconstruction with equations"},{"key":"review_status","html":"source-construction-and-local-proof"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})\">\\(\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)\\)</span>、位置项、代换与两种判断采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"435152fdfa38036a\" href=\"?note=435152fdfa38036a\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntax\">16-df-stlc-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau}\">\\([t]_{\\sigma,\\tau}\\)</span> 表示在单变量语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\sigma)\">\\((\\sigma)\\)</span> 中型为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 的项的下述等式商类。箭头使用源/靶标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})\">\\((\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})\\)</span>；后续公式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[t]:\\sigma\\to\\tau\">\\([t]:\\sigma\\to\\tau\\)</span> 是该带标签箭头的简写。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\Gamma\">\\(P_\\Gamma\\)</span> 是待构造的语境积类型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\Gamma,i}\">\\(q_{\\Gamma,i}\\)</span> 是单变量语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P_\\Gamma)\">\\((P_\\Gamma)\\)</span> 中的投影项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_\\Gamma(\\mathbf t)\">\\(a_\\Gamma(\\mathbf t)\\)</span> 的各输入在同一语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 中且型属依次为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(\\gamma_1,\\ldots,\\gamma_n)\">\\(\\Gamma=(\\gamma_1,\\ldots,\\gamma_n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta=(\\delta_1,\\ldots,\\delta_m)\">\\(\\Delta=(\\delta_1,\\ldots,\\delta_m)\\)</span>。所有下述商箭头均只对良型的项使用。</li>\n<li>配对构造中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[t]:\\alpha\\to\\sigma\">\\([t]:\\alpha\\to\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[u]:\\alpha\\to\\tau\">\\([u]:\\alpha\\to\\tau\\)</span>；最后的等式反映式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma u:\\tau\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma u:\\tau\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>，下文以同一带标签Hom、恒等与复合构造其六元组。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_{\\mathrm g}\">\\(\\Theta_{\\mathrm g}\\)</span> 是下文组装的所选 CCC 操作记录；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!,p_1,p_2,\\langle-,-\\rangle,\\operatorname{ev},\\Lambda\">\\(!,p_1,p_2,\\langle-,-\\rangle,\\operatorname{ev},\\Lambda\\)</span> 分别表示本页按对象、Hom 指标已经给定的完整函数族。该记录供泛模型使用，不再要求一个额外的未指定结构选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_{\\sigma,\\tau}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_1\\mid(\\sigma)\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau\\},\\\\\nt\\sim_{\\sigma,\\tau}u&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\sigma)\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:\\tau,\\\\\n[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{u\\in T_{\\sigma,\\tau}\\mid t\\sim_{\\sigma,\\tau}u\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathsf S_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B),\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})\\mid t\\in T_{\\sigma,\\tau}\\},\\\\\n1_\\sigma&amp;\\coloneqq[x_1]:\\sigma\\to\\sigma,\\\\\n[u]\\circ[t]&amp;\\coloneqq[u[t]]:\\sigma\\to\\upsilon\\quad([t]:\\sigma\\to\\tau,\\ [u]:\\tau\\to\\upsilon).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_{\\sigma,\\tau}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_1\\mid(\\sigma)\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau\\},\\\\\nt\\sim_{\\sigma,\\tau}u&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\sigma)\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:\\tau,\\\\\n[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{u\\in T_{\\sigma,\\tau}\\mid t\\sim_{\\sigma,\\tau}u\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathsf S_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B),\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})\\mid t\\in T_{\\sigma,\\tau}\\},\\\\\n1_\\sigma&amp;\\coloneqq[x_1]:\\sigma\\to\\sigma,\\\\\n[u]\\circ[t]&amp;\\coloneqq[u[t]]:\\sigma\\to\\upsilon\\quad([t]:\\sigma\\to\\tau,\\ [u]:\\tau\\to\\upsilon).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B),\\\\\nM_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\sigma,\\tau\\in O_\\Sigma}\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau),\\\\\ns_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma,\\qquad t_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})\\coloneqq\\tau,\\\\\ne_\\Sigma(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq1_\\sigma,\\\\\nc_\\Sigma([u],[t])&amp;\\coloneqq[u]\\circ[t],\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\Sigma,M_\\Sigma,s_\\Sigma,t_\\Sigma,e_\\Sigma,c_\\Sigma\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathsf S_\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B),\\\\\nM_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\sigma,\\tau\\in O_\\Sigma}\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau),\\\\\ns_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma,\\qquad t_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})\\coloneqq\\tau,\\\\\ne_\\Sigma(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq1_\\sigma,\\\\\nc_\\Sigma([u],[t])&amp;\\coloneqq[u]\\circ[t],\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\Sigma,M_\\Sigma,s_\\Sigma,t_\\Sigma,e_\\Sigma,c_\\Sigma\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathsf S_\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n1_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq1,&amp;!_\\sigma&amp;\\coloneqq[*]:\\sigma\\to1,\\\\\n\\sigma\\times_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma}\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma\\times\\tau,&amp;p_j&amp;\\coloneqq[\\pi_jx_1]:\\sigma_1\\times\\sigma_2\\to\\sigma_j,\\\\\n\\langle[t],[u]\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq[\\langle t,u\\rangle]:\\alpha\\to\\sigma\\times\\tau,\\\\\n\\tau^\\sigma_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma\\to\\tau,&amp;\\operatorname{ev}_{\\sigma,\\tau}&amp;\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{app}(\\pi_1x_1,\\pi_2x_1)]:(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\times\\sigma\\to\\tau,\\\\\n\\Lambda_{\\alpha,\\sigma,\\tau}([v])&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda_\\sigma S_{1,2}(v;\\langle x_1,x_2\\rangle)]:\\alpha\\to(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\quad([v]:\\alpha\\times\\sigma\\to\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n1_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq1,&amp;!_\\sigma&amp;\\coloneqq[*]:\\sigma\\to1,\\\\\n\\sigma\\times_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma}\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma\\times\\tau,&amp;p_j&amp;\\coloneqq[\\pi_jx_1]:\\sigma_1\\times\\sigma_2\\to\\sigma_j,\\\\\n\\langle[t],[u]\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq[\\langle t,u\\rangle]:\\alpha\\to\\sigma\\times\\tau,\\\\\n\\tau^\\sigma_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma\\to\\tau,&amp;\\operatorname{ev}_{\\sigma,\\tau}&amp;\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{app}(\\pi_1x_1,\\pi_2x_1)]:(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\times\\sigma\\to\\tau,\\\\\n\\Lambda_{\\alpha,\\sigma,\\tau}([v])&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda_\\sigma S_{1,2}(v;\\langle x_1,x_2\\rangle)]:\\alpha\\to(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\quad([v]:\\alpha\\times\\sigma\\to\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,1)=\\{!_\\alpha\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\sigma\\times\\tau)\\xrightarrow[\\langle-,-\\rangle]{\\ (p_1\\circ-,p_2\\circ-)\\ }\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\sigma)\\times\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha\\times\\sigma,\\tau)\\xrightarrow[\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(-\\times1_\\sigma)]{\\ \\Lambda\\ }\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\sigma\\to\\tau),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathsf S_\\Sigma).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,1)=\\{!_\\alpha\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\sigma\\times\\tau)\\xrightarrow[\\langle-,-\\rangle]{\\ (p_1\\circ-,p_2\\circ-)\\ }\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\sigma)\\times\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha\\times\\sigma,\\tau)\\xrightarrow[\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(-\\times1_\\sigma)]{\\ \\Lambda\\ }\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\sigma\\to\\tau),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathsf S_\\Sigma).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle1_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma},!,\\times_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma},p_1,p_2,\n\\langle-,-\\rangle,(-)^{(-)}_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma},\\operatorname{ev},\\Lambda\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Theta_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle1_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma},!,\\times_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma},p_1,p_2,\n\\langle-,-\\rangle,(-)^{(-)}_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma},\\operatorname{ev},\\Lambda\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP_{()}&amp;\\coloneqq1,&amp;P_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq P_\\Gamma\\times\\sigma,\\\\\nq_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,i}&amp;\\coloneqq S_{1,1}(q_{\\Gamma,i};\\pi_1x_1)\\quad(i\\in[n]),&amp;q_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_2x_1,\\\\\na_{()}()&amp;\\coloneqq *,&amp;a_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t_1,\\ldots,t_n,s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a_\\Gamma(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),s\\rangle,\\\\\nt^\\flat_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq S_{n,1}(t;q_{\\Gamma,1},\\ldots,q_{\\Gamma,n}),&amp;e_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq a_\\Gamma(x_1,\\ldots,x_n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP_{()}&amp;\\coloneqq1,&amp;P_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}&amp;\\coloneqq P_\\Gamma\\times\\sigma,\\\\\nq_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,i}&amp;\\coloneqq S_{1,1}(q_{\\Gamma,i};\\pi_1x_1)\\quad(i\\in[n]),&amp;q_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_2x_1,\\\\\na_{()}()&amp;\\coloneqq *,&amp;a_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t_1,\\ldots,t_n,s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a_\\Gamma(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),s\\rangle,\\\\\nt^\\flat_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq S_{n,1}(t;q_{\\Gamma,1},\\ldots,q_{\\Gamma,n}),&amp;e_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq a_\\Gamma(x_1,\\ldots,x_n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n(P_\\Gamma)\\vdash_\\Sigma q_{\\Gamma,i}:\\gamma_i,\\qquad\n\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma a_\\Gamma(\\mathbf t):P_\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma q_{\\Gamma,i}[a_\\Gamma(\\mathbf t)]\\equiv t_i:\\gamma_i,\\qquad\n\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma a_\\Gamma(q_{\\Gamma,1}[v],\\ldots,q_{\\Gamma,n}[v])\\equiv v:P_\\Gamma\\quad(\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma v:P_\\Gamma),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t^\\flat_\\Gamma[e_\\Gamma]\\equiv t:\\tau\\quad(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau),\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow[t^\\flat_\\Gamma]_{P_\\Gamma,\\tau}=[u^\\flat_\\Gamma]_{P_\\Gamma,\\tau}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n(P_\\Gamma)\\vdash_\\Sigma q_{\\Gamma,i}:\\gamma_i,\\qquad\n\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma a_\\Gamma(\\mathbf t):P_\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma q_{\\Gamma,i}[a_\\Gamma(\\mathbf t)]\\equiv t_i:\\gamma_i,\\qquad\n\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma a_\\Gamma(q_{\\Gamma,1}[v],\\ldots,q_{\\Gamma,n}[v])\\equiv v:P_\\Gamma\\quad(\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma v:P_\\Gamma),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t^\\flat_\\Gamma[e_\\Gamma]\\equiv t:\\tau\\quad(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau),\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow[t^\\flat_\\Gamma]_{P_\\Gamma,\\tau}=[u^\\flat_\\Gamma]_{P_\\Gamma,\\tau}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{\\mathrm g}(b)\\coloneqq b,\\qquad\n\\kappa_{\\mathrm g,c}\\coloneqq[c((q_{\\boldsymbol\\sigma,j})_{j=1}^{|\\boldsymbol\\sigma|})]:P_{\\boldsymbol\\sigma}\\to\\tau\n\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=(\\boldsymbol\\sigma,\\tau)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{\\mathrm g}(b)\\coloneqq b,\\qquad\n\\kappa_{\\mathrm g,c}\\coloneqq[c((q_{\\boldsymbol\\sigma,j})_{j=1}^{|\\boldsymbol\\sigma|})]:P_{\\boldsymbol\\sigma}\\to\\tau\n\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=(\\boldsymbol\\sigma,\\tau)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 Proposition2.3.2，pp.139–140（PDF159–160），正是类型为对象、单变量项的转换类为箭头的 CCC；其评价/抽象公式在 p.140。Exercise2.3.3，p.146（PDF166），要求任意长度语境与单变量积语境的对应。这里补出含空语境的递归投影/元组及两向计算，并允许规范语法原子中的等式规格。</li>\n<li>良定义性：等式的相容与代换规则保证复合、配对和抽象不依赖代表元。代换恒等律与结合律给范畴律。单元 η 给终对象；积 β 给投影配对等式，积 η 给唯一性；箭头 β/η 与积 η 给评价和抽象互逆。图中的两个映射因此是互逆双射。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i[a(\\mathbf t)]\\equiv t_i\">\\(q_i[a(\\mathbf t)]\\equiv t_i\\)</span> 对语境长度归纳，用积 β；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(q_i[v])\\equiv v\">\\(a(q_i[v])\\equiv v\\)</span> 归纳用积 η，空语境使用单元 η。代换结合律继而给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t^\\flat[e]\\equiv t\">\\(t^\\flat[e]\\equiv t\\)</span>。最后的双向式：正向把原等式代换到投影上；反向把单变量等式代换回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_\\Gamma\">\\(e_\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf S_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是集合编码的小范畴，因类型树、项树及各商都是集合。一般 CCC 不必拥有足够多全局元素；本构造也没有用全局元素区分箭头。语义的泛模型只需该本地句法 CCC，不依赖强一阶 DTT 项模型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"435152fdfa38036a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"435152fdfa38036a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})$、$\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)$、位置项、代换与两种判断采用 [[16-df-stlc-syntax]]；$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})$、$\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)$、位置项、代换与两种判断采用 [[16-df-stlc-syntax]]；$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"配对构造中 $[t]:\\alpha\\to\\sigma$、$[u]:\\alpha\\to\\tau$；最后的等式反映式中 $\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau$、$\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma u:\\tau$。$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]，下文以同一带标签Hom、恒等与复合构造其六元组。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CCC}","display":false},{"tex":"[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"(\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})","display":false},{"tex":"[t]:\\sigma\\to\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"q_{\\Gamma,i}","display":false},{"tex":"(P_\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"a_\\Gamma(\\mathbf t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=(\\gamma_1,\\ldots,\\gamma_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta=(\\delta_1,\\ldots,\\delta_m)","display":false},{"tex":"[t]:\\alpha\\to\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"[u]:\\alpha\\to\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma u:\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta_{\\mathrm g}","display":false},{"tex":"!,p_1,p_2,\\langle-,-\\rangle,\\operatorname{ev},\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_{\\sigma,\\tau}&\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathsf{Raw}_1\\mid(\\sigma)\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau\\},\\\\\nt\\sim_{\\sigma,\\tau}u&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\sigma)\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:\\tau,\\\\\n[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau}&\\coloneqq\\{u\\in T_{\\sigma,\\tau}\\mid t\\sim_{\\sigma,\\tau}u\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathsf S_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B),\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau)&\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})\\mid t\\in T_{\\sigma,\\tau}\\},\\\\\n1_\\sigma&\\coloneqq[x_1]:\\sigma\\to\\sigma,\\\\\n[u]\\circ[t]&\\coloneqq[u[t]]:\\sigma\\to\\upsilon\\quad([t]:\\sigma\\to\\tau,\\ [u]:\\tau\\to\\upsilon).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B),\\\\\nM_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\sigma,\\tau\\in O_\\Sigma}\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau),\\\\\ns_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})&\\coloneqq\\sigma,\\qquad t_\\Sigma(\\sigma,\\tau,[t]_{\\sigma,\\tau})\\coloneqq\\tau,\\\\\ne_\\Sigma(\\sigma)&\\coloneqq1_\\sigma,\\\\\nc_\\Sigma([u],[t])&\\coloneqq[u]\\circ[t],\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\Sigma,M_\\Sigma,s_\\Sigma,t_\\Sigma,e_\\Sigma,c_\\Sigma\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathsf S_\\Sigma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n1_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma}&\\coloneqq1,&!_\\sigma&\\coloneqq[*]:\\sigma\\to1,\\\\\n\\sigma\\times_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma}\\tau&\\coloneqq\\sigma\\times\\tau,&p_j&\\coloneqq[\\pi_jx_1]:\\sigma_1\\times\\sigma_2\\to\\sigma_j,\\\\\n\\langle[t],[u]\\rangle&\\coloneqq[\\langle t,u\\rangle]:\\alpha\\to\\sigma\\times\\tau,\\\\\n\\tau^\\sigma_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma}&\\coloneqq\\sigma\\to\\tau,&\\operatorname{ev}_{\\sigma,\\tau}&\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{app}(\\pi_1x_1,\\pi_2x_1)]:(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\times\\sigma\\to\\tau,\\\\\n\\Lambda_{\\alpha,\\sigma,\\tau}([v])&\\coloneqq[\\lambda_\\sigma S_{1,2}(v;\\langle x_1,x_2\\rangle)]:\\alpha\\to(\\sigma\\to\\tau)\\quad([v]:\\alpha\\times\\sigma\\to\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,1)=\\{!_\\alpha\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\sigma\\times\\tau)\\xrightarrow[\\langle-,-\\rangle]{\\ (p_1\\circ-,p_2\\circ-)\\ }\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\sigma)\\times\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha\\times\\sigma,\\tau)\\xrightarrow[\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(-\\times1_\\sigma)]{\\ \\Lambda\\ }\\mathsf S_\\Sigma(\\alpha,\\sigma\\to\\tau),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathsf S_\\Sigma).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Theta_{\\mathrm g}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle1_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma},!,\\times_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma},p_1,p_2,\n\\langle-,-\\rangle,(-)^{(-)}_{\\mathsf S_\\Sigma},\\operatorname{ev},\\Lambda\\right\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP_{()}&\\coloneqq1,&P_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}&\\coloneqq P_\\Gamma\\times\\sigma,\\\\\nq_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,i}&\\coloneqq S_{1,1}(q_{\\Gamma,i};\\pi_1x_1)\\quad(i\\in[n]),&q_{\\Gamma,\\sigma,n+1}&\\coloneqq\\pi_2x_1,\\\\\na_{()}()&\\coloneqq *,&a_{\\Gamma,\\sigma}(t_1,\\ldots,t_n,s)&\\coloneqq\\langle a_\\Gamma(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),s\\rangle,\\\\\nt^\\flat_\\Gamma&\\coloneqq S_{n,1}(t;q_{\\Gamma,1},\\ldots,q_{\\Gamma,n}),&e_\\Gamma&\\coloneqq a_\\Gamma(x_1,\\ldots,x_n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n(P_\\Gamma)\\vdash_\\Sigma q_{\\Gamma,i}:\\gamma_i,\\qquad\n\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma a_\\Gamma(\\mathbf t):P_\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma q_{\\Gamma,i}[a_\\Gamma(\\mathbf t)]\\equiv t_i:\\gamma_i,\\qquad\n\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma a_\\Gamma(q_{\\Gamma,1}[v],\\ldots,q_{\\Gamma,n}[v])\\equiv v:P_\\Gamma\\quad(\\Delta\\vdash_\\Sigma v:P_\\Gamma),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t^\\flat_\\Gamma[e_\\Gamma]\\equiv t:\\tau\\quad(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau),\\\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t\\equiv u:\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow[t^\\flat_\\Gamma]_{P_\\Gamma,\\tau}=[u^\\flat_\\Gamma]_{P_\\Gamma,\\tau}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho_{\\mathrm g}(b)\\coloneqq b,\\qquad\n\\kappa_{\\mathrm g,c}\\coloneqq[c((q_{\\boldsymbol\\sigma,j})_{j=1}^{|\\boldsymbol\\sigma|})]:P_{\\boldsymbol\\sigma}\\to\\tau\n\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=(\\boldsymbol\\sigma,\\tau)).","display":true},{"tex":"q_i[a(\\mathbf t)]\\equiv t_i","display":false},{"tex":"a(q_i[v])\\equiv v","display":false},{"tex":"t^\\flat[e]\\equiv t","display":false},{"tex":"e_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_\\Sigma","display":false}],"bytes":6835,"backlinks":[{"id":"004562375f0e2ba1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"带指数的简单类型演算另有 [[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]；依赖语境另有 [[16-df-context-category]]。本页不把这三种不同的语法接口混成一个未经展开的 $\\Sigma$。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]、[[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]、[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]、[[16-thm-categorical-completeness]]、[[16-df-lambda-systems]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-signature]]、[[16-df-hagino-functor]]、[[16-thm-weak-initial-algebra]]、[[16-ex-church-weak-nno]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]、[[16-df-lambda-fibrations]]。"},{"id":"85c36bdc2628e3c0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})$ 是 [[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]] 采用的有限积简单类型签名，$\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:\\tau$、$\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma u:\\tau$。$P_\\Gamma$、$t^\\flat_\\Gamma$、$\\mathsf S_\\Sigma$、$\\rho_{\\mathrm g}$、$\\kappa_{\\mathrm g}$ 及其选定 CCC 结构 $\\Theta_{\\mathrm g}$ 采用该页构造。"}],"outgoing":["435152fdfa38036a","18a4c8ba03fadf06","25a281534aa42440"]}